    ["{{年轻人，嘴还挺甜。但是光说没用，等你看她们看腻了，也请我一杯酒，如何？|你嘴真甜。可惜，这里的灯火，从来不等待任何人。 }}"] = "{{Young man, you have a sweet tongue. But talk is cheap. When you get tired of looking at them, how about buying me a drink? |You have a sweet tongue. It's a pity, the lights here never wait for anyone. }}",
    ["……太独特了，我还是喜欢吃普通口味。"] = "…It's too unique, I still prefer the regular flavor.",
    ["　　银雾森林迎来了今年的第一场雪，东边的雾气也越发浓厚，掉落了不少羽毛的戴莉在窝里冻得直发抖。枝头小小的巢穴无法抵御寒冷，顶上抖落的一坨雪将巢穴砸落下去，戴莉还没来得及发出叫声，就发现自己被温暖的灰色皮毛包裹——它落在了一只灰麋鹿的头顶。\n\n 　　“我察觉到这里有动物需要帮助，是你吗？”那只灰麋鹿这么说道。\n\n 　　“如果你是来给我带来温暖的，那确实是我。”恢复了体温的戴莉在麋鹿的头顶蹦跶了几下，继续说道：“我叫戴莉， 你的名字是什么？”\n\n　　 “我是……抱歉，我忘记了我的名字。”\n\n　　戴莉这才注意到，麋鹿的角上挂着许多小木牌，上面写着“我叫邓恩”、我是森林的守护者”、“每天巡逻看谁需要帮助”……\n\n　　 “你叫邓恩，”戴莉轻声说，她听树洞里的松鼠一家提起过这头每到冬天就会失忆的麋鹿，曾一天给他们送了三次松子，“你是银雾森林的守护者。”"] = "The Silver Mist Forest welcomed its first snow of the year, and the mist in the east became thicker. Daly, having lost many feathers, shivered in the nest. The small nest on the branch could not resist the cold, and a lump of snow shaken from above knocked the nest down. Before Daly could even make a sound, she found herself wrapped in warm gray fur—it had landed on the head of a gray elk. \n\n \"I sensed that an animal here needed help, is it you?\" the gray elk said. \n\n \"If you are here to bring me warmth, then it is indeed me.\" Having regained her body temperature, Daly hopped a few times on the elk's head and continued: \"My name is Daly, what is your name?\" \n\n \"I am... sorry, I forgot my name.\" \n\n Daly then noticed that the elk's antlers were hung with many small wooden signs, which read \"My name is Dunn\", \"I am the guardian of the forest\", \"Patrol every day to see who needs help\"... \n\n \"Your name is Dunn,\" Daly said softly. She had heard the squirrel family in the tree hole mention this elk that would lose its memory every winter, who had once delivered pine nuts to them three times in one day, \"You are the guardian of the Silver Mist Forest.\"",
